=== complexTypeInDeclaration
let x : T<A, B> | false = a < b && new T()
--- ast
(Decl
  ^x
  \type
  (Call #desugarOperation | (Call #<> T A B) false)
  \init
  (Call #desugarOperation && (Call #desugarOperation < a b) (Call new T)))

=== constructorExpressionOfParameterizedType
x = new T<u>(a < b, (c > d))
--- ast
