=== functionWithBellsAndWhistles
fn f(x: number, y = null): number|string { return y ?? "" + x; }
--- ast
(Call
  fn
  \word
  ^f
  (Block \_complexArg_ x \type number)
  (Block \_complexArg_ y \default null)
  \outType
  (Call #desugarOperation | number string)
  (Fun
    (Block
      (Call
        return
        (Call #desugarOperation ?? y (Call #desugarOperation + "" x)))
      #void)))

